---
description: Raabta Home design rules
globs: lib/features/home/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/raabta_home_design_kit.md`.

- Use color-family tokens only. No hardcoded hex colors.
- Use a maximum of 3 base hues per screen.
- No blur in light mode.
- Never use fake data.
- Never display money figures on Home.
- Respect reduced-motion settings.
- Preserve existing features and navigation unless explicitly approved.
- Do not modify the Home AI Assistant or its related widgets unless Prompt 1 identifies a specific dependency and the user approves it.
- Audit first. Do not change source code until the user approves the findings.
